{"root":{"data":{"id":"dmu3npfdhk00","created":1794574755385,"text":"集成学习","font-weight":"bold"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmu3oc529eo0","created":1794574804828,"text":"个体与集成"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmu3ozbvo2g0","created":1794574855306,"text":"集成学习定义"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmu3p27kj3k0","created":1794574861576,"text":"通过构建并结合多个学习器来完成学习任务，亦称多分类器系统、基于委员会的学习。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmu3pbevjs00","created":1794574881608,"text":"组成"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmu3pfkdfoo0","created":1794574890648,"text":"个体学习器"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmu3pvspg5c0","created":1794574925980,"text":"可以是决策树、神经网络等；若全部为同类型，称为同质集成，个体叫基学习器，对应算法叫基学习算法；若个体类型不同，叫异质集成，个体称为组件学习器。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmu3q0p030g0","created":1794574936640,"text":"集成"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmu3q37weps0","created":1794574942136,"text":"将多个个体学习器输出结合得到最终预测结果。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmu3q5wgzwg0","created":1794574947976,"text":"集成效果前提"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmu3ofe070w0","created":1794574811899,"text":"Boosting"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmu3oiuk8ug0","created":1794574819430,"text":"Bagging与随机森林"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmu3ono25rk0","created":1794574829921,"text":"结合策略"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmu3oqwiza80","created":1794574836963,"text":"多样性"},"children":[]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}